      "problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=\\operatorname{tan}⁡x?$ Assume that $n$ is an integer.\n\nI. The domain of the function is all real numbers except $x=\\frac{\\pi }{2}+n\\pi $\n\nII. The function has zeros at $x=\\frac{\\pi }{2}+n\\pi $ for any integer $n$\n\nIII. The range of the function is $y\\in (-\\frac{\\pi }{4},\\frac{\\pi }{4})$",
